WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.012
Your donor data lives in your CRM.

2
00:00:02.022 --> 00:00:04.543
Your reports should never fall out of step
with it.

3
00:00:04.553 --> 00:00:07.921
Storyraise Connections keeps the two in
sync, in both directions, with Raiser's

4
00:00:07.931 --> 00:00:10.917
Edge NXT and Salesforce.

5
00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:13.628
Every system you connect gets one row.

6
00:00:13.725 --> 00:00:18.957
Its status, who it brings across, when it
last ran, and what it has sent back.

7
00:00:19.527 --> 00:00:21.212
Connecting takes a few minutes.

8
00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:24.591
You sign in with Blackbaud or Salesforce
and approve access.

9
00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:26.692
Then you choose who comes across:

10
00:00:26.702 --> 00:00:30.639
a Raiser's Edge list, or one or more
Salesforce List Views.

11
00:00:30.649 --> 00:00:35.016
From Salesforce you can bring extra fields
too, and each one becomes a merge tag for

12
00:00:35.026 --> 00:00:36.688
your reports.

13
00:00:36.698 --> 00:00:38.267
Then turn on Auto-sync.

14
00:00:38.277 --> 00:00:41.982
Storyraise pulls your list again every
day, or every Monday if weekly suits you

15
00:00:41.992 --> 00:00:42.818
better.

16
00:00:42.828 --> 00:00:47.636
New donors, new gifts, and updated details
reach your reports without anyone

17
00:00:47.646 --> 00:00:49.152
exporting a thing.

18
00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:53.674
And Sync now runs it on the spot, right
before a big send.

19
00:00:53.684 --> 00:00:55.752
It is not only names and emails.

20
00:00:55.762 --> 00:01:00.791
Add data brings across Raiser's Edge gifts
or Salesforce Opportunities, so each

21
00:01:00.801 --> 00:01:03.648
report can thank a donor for their own
giving.

22
00:01:03.658 --> 00:01:05.227
And the data flows back.

23
00:01:05.237 --> 00:01:09.534
Storyraise knows who opened their report,
how long they read, and what they clicked.

24
00:01:09.544 --> 00:01:12.959
Send to Raiser's Edge writes that onto
each constituent's record as a completed

25
00:01:12.969 --> 00:01:14.521
action.

26
00:01:15.258 --> 00:01:20.577
One action per donor, updated as they read
more, so the record never fills up with

27
00:01:20.587 --> 00:01:21.831
duplicates.

28
00:01:21.841 --> 00:01:25.662
Assign it to the donor's fundraiser, and
send only the donors above the level of

29
00:01:25.672 --> 00:01:28.008
engagement you choose.

30
00:01:28.018 --> 00:01:32.071
In Salesforce, it is one completed Task on
each Contact, assigned to their gift

31
00:01:32.081 --> 00:01:33.395
officer if you like.

32
00:01:33.405 --> 00:01:38.353
Save it once, and engagement goes back on
every scheduled sync.

33
00:01:38.363 --> 00:01:41.766
Bloomerang, Virtuous, DonorPerfect, and
more connect the same way.

34
00:01:41.776 --> 00:01:46.022
Connect your CRM once, and your reports
and your records stay in step.
